WEBVTT

00:00:06.998 --> 00:00:13.996
A report header can combine a logo, an organization name, contact details and a second mark on the opposite side.

00:00:18.436 --> 00:00:26.484
Start with a fictional discharge summary. The hospital logo and quality seal are separate image elements, with editable text between them.

00:00:33.155 --> 00:00:39.051
Preview the editable version to review the two-sided logo layout, patient details and sign-off footer.

00:00:45.005 --> 00:00:52.704
For stationery that is already printed, open the pre-printed letterhead sample. Its full-page design sits behind the report content.

00:00:57.873 --> 00:01:06.631
Use either approach: arrange separate logos in the designer, or leave the printed header and footer in the background and place your report content in the clear space.
